I find it easier (and quicker) to stand *on* the polymorph trap (having 
MR, of course), whistle my pet next to me, and then displace it onto the 
trap. Since whistling will always put it next to you, and displacing 
will always make it change places with you, this is much more effective.

When you're standing next to the trap, there's only a 1/8 chance that 
your pet will end up where you want it to.

